/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Success in almost every business depends upon the right blend of strategies & operations. While the top  management is involved in the former, it is the Middle-level which, acting as a strong interface, is actually  implementing them with the support of junior management. The Middle level thus needs to have the right skills to  first understand the planned strategies in their corresponding functions and then communicate well to the junior  management for successful implementation.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
